Package: tacklet
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.10), xdotool
Suggests: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: fast, private sticky notes for Ubuntu GNOME
 Tacklet is a lightweight GTK 4 sticky-notes application. Notes, settings,
 backups and deleted-note history stay in a private local JSON file.
 .
 Exact note positioning on GNOME Wayland is provided through XWayland and
 xdotool. The tray indicator is available when the AppIndicators GNOME
 extension is enabled.
